Project Verbarium {
  database_type: 'PostgreSQL'
  Note: '''
  Canonical source of truth for Verbarium's evolving relational data model.

  Model only durable decisions here. Hylia records the reasoning behind them.
  The passage schema is intentionally being introduced incrementally.
  '''
}

// First modeling target: passage architecture.
//
// Durable conceptual model:
// - Passage is the reusable passage-level entity.
// - An Attestation is one source-language textual form of a Passage.
// - A Translation is one translated rendering of a Passage and does not
//   imply knowledge of which Attestation the translator historically used.
// - An Alignment connects one Attestation with one Translation for Verbarium's
//   structured correspondence/mapping data.
//
// No tables are declared yet because field-level and identifier decisions
// are not settled.
